  "brakes": {
   "title": "LOCKED ON THE SCALE",
   "sub": "BRAKES & AIR SYSTEMS",
   "track": "Thunder",
   "text": "Brakes locked up on the scale? That's the kind of stop that can turn into an out-of-service order and a lost day. At Car Hauler Repair Houston we fix trailer brakes that lock or drag, and we service the air system that feeds them: leaking lines, dead glad hands and pressure that keeps dropping. We work on brake chambers, drums, shoes, hubs, bearings and seals, the whole running gear under a car carrier. Why does the air side matter so much? Because brakes can only work as well as the air system behind them. When the job is done, your rig goes back out scale-legal and road ready, with an air system that holds pressure. Locked up right now? Call the number on screen.",
