  "dealer": {
   "title": "A WEEK AT THE DEALER?",
   "sub": "DOWNTIME WITH EXTRA STEPS",
   "track": "Fields of space",
   "text": "Your carrier breaks down, and then the second breakdown starts. The dealer says they can look at it next week. The truck shop parks it in the yard while a general tech reads a laptop code and guesses on your clock. The mobile guy promises two hours and stops answering. And then the bill shows up with work nobody approved. So what's different here? Car Hauler Repair Houston works on car carriers only. Eugene, the shop director, answers the phone himself, senior master techs do the work, and you get an exact price in writing before anything is touched. Most common carrier failures turn around the same day. Skip the second breakdown and get your afternoon back. Call the number on screen.",
