  "brands": {
   "title": "YOUR BRAND, OUR BAY",
   "sub": "CARRIERS ONLY, EVERY MAKE",
   "track": "Symphony one",
   "text": "Does the brand of your trailer matter to us? Only because we know it. Car Hauler Repair Houston is a Cottrell authorized warranty repair center, and we also service Take Three, Sun Country, Boydstun, Delavan, Miller, Kaufman and custom multi-deck builds. Our senior master techs specialize in car carriers, with wet kits, PTOs, head ramps, decks and hydraulics, instead of general trucks. Running a custom build or a rare brand? Bring it anyway. If it's on a car carrier, we repair it in this bay, with hoses crimped and welding done right here. Tell us the brand and roughly how old it is when you call, and we'll know what we're looking at before you pull in. Call the number on screen.",
