  "headramps": {
   "title": "STUCK HEAD RAMP",
   "sub": "DECKS & RAMPS BACK IN SEQUENCE",
   "track": "Hyde and seek",
   "text": "A head ramp that binds, a deck that drifts, a ramp that moves out of sequence. Every one of those costs you a slot, and a slot is a car you can't haul. At Car Hauler Repair Houston we work on decks, ramps and head ramps that are slow, stuck or binding, along with the guide tracks, pull-out decks and overhead racks they depend on. And when the problem is steel, not hydraulics? Cracked ramps, broken brackets and damaged decks are welded and rebuilt right here until they carry full weight again. We don't stop at making it move. We make every position usable again and ready to load. Losing slots to a stubborn ramp? Call the number on screen and get them back.",
