  "towornot": {
   "title": "LIMP IT IN OR TOW?",
   "sub": "AN HONEST ANSWER FIRST",
   "track": "Thunder",
   "text": "Your rig just quit on the road. Can you drive it in, or do you need a tow? That's the first question most drivers ask, and it deserves a straight answer. Call Car Hauler Repair Houston, describe what happened, and Eugene will tell you honestly whether to limp it in or get a tow. Why trust that answer? Because we don't own tow trucks, we don't have a tow partner, and nobody here gets a referral cut. There's simply no reason to tell you anything but the truth. If you're still loaded, tell us how many units you're carrying and where they sit, and we'll confirm before you head our way. One honest call, and you know your next move.",
