  "framegeo": {
   "title": "BENT FRAME?",
   "sub": "GEOMETRY RESTORED",
   "track": "Kama Sutra",
   "text": "After an accident, or after years of heavy loads, a car hauler frame can lose its geometry. And when the frame is out of shape, nothing built on top of it works the way it should. At Car Hauler Repair Houston we straighten and realign frames using hydraulic pulling equipment. But straightening is only the start. Fatigued or damaged steel is cut out, replacement sections are fabricated, and high-stress areas are reinforced with properly fitted structural plates, gussets and extra supports. We work on main frame rails, tandem sections, front frames and kingpin areas, crossmembers and side beams. The goal is a structure that sits true and carries its load again. Frame out of shape? Bring it to Car Hauler Repair Houston.",
