  "cottrellclaim": {
   "title": "COTTRELL CLAIM?",
   "sub": "HOW WARRANTY WORK HAPPENS",
   "track": "Hollywood waves",
   "text": "Something failed on your Cottrell while it's still under warranty. What now? First, the claim goes to Cottrell. Have your VIN and photos of the problem ready, because Cottrell approves the claim and issues a work order before any repair begins. Even parts made by other suppliers, like axles, suspension, lighting, hoses and hydraulic valves, are handled through Cottrell. So where does the work get done? At an authorized repair center, and Car Hauler Repair Houston is a Cottrell authorized warranty repair center right here in Houston. The covered work is done in our bay without the dealer's week-long queue, and the failed parts go back to Cottrell. One more thing: the factory warranty stays with the original buyer. Cottrell owner? Call us first.",
